  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 3 December 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nImagine starting your morning with a coffee on the balcony, taking in the sea views, and ending the day with a glass of wine as the sun goes down. This is the kind of lifestyle that makes coming home something to look forward to.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned down a quiet lane, this beautifully finished, brand-new home sits on a generous 631sqm section, offering space, privacy and the relaxed coastal lifestyle Orewa is known for.\r\n\r\nWith approximately 280sqm of thoughtfully designed space, the home combines modern comfort with a warm, welcoming feel. Natural light, warm timber tones and soft neutral finishes create a relaxed atmosphere throughout.\r\n\r\nThe stylish kitchen, featuring a generous island and a separate second kitchen area, sits at the heart of the home. Open-plan living and dining flow effortlessly outdoors, perfect for family dinners, summer BBQs or simply enjoying a quiet afternoon.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a spacious second lounge opens onto a balcony with sea views — your own peaceful spot to relax, read a book or enjoy a little time to yourself.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this home special:\r\n\r\n- Space for the whole family: Five bedrooms, three bathrooms, a separate guest toilet and multiple living areas.\r\n- Flexible living: A ground-floor bedroom suite with its own ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and separate external access, ideal for extended family or guests.\r\n- Beautifully finished interiors: Contemporary design with soft neutral tones, stylish bathrooms, ducted central air conditioning and a built-in audio system for added comfort and enjoyment.\r\n- Sea views and outdoor living: An upstairs lounge opening to a generous balcony, plus easy indoor-outdoor flow downstairs.\r\n- 631sqm of land: A generous section offering privacy, outdoor space and room to enjoy family life.\r\n- Room for your lifestyle: Double internal-access garage plus approximately three off-street parking spaces, with potential space for a boat or campervan.\r\n\r\nEnjoy everything Orewa has to offer, from its beautiful beach and coastal walks to local cafés, restaurants and shops. Convenient access to SH1 makes commuting and weekend trips easy.\r\n\r\nWhether it's a day out on the water, a relaxed BBQ with friends or a quiet evening enjoying the sea views, this is a home where everyday living feels just that little bit better.\r\n\r\nA beautiful home, plenty of space, and a lifestyle to match.",
